    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Significantly reduce the depth\"—do you mean that, like, you won't be able to do the job they actually hired you for? The board sees this as a way to make you more reliable, but I'm curious if you think anything vital is actually being lost here. Like, is there a difference between a database and what you're doing now in terms of the museum's mission?",
